{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manipulate enemy positions and make use of clever combos in this tactical turn-based strategy game with a focus on creativity rather than number crunching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Carnage Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What if Into the Breach had a full campaign?</i> That question sparked the creation of <strong>Dark Pact</strong>, a game designed to push your tactical skills to the limit while delivering an emotional, gripping story. Inspired by <strong>Fire Emblem, Advance Wars, and Into the Breach</strong>, Dark Pact aims to stand alongside these legendary titles. Does it succeed? Play the demo and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_1.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master Devastating Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory isn\u2019t just about dealing damage\u2014it\u2019s about control. Abilities in Dark Pact don\u2019t just hit hard; they <strong>push, pull, taunt, and disrupt</strong>, keeping the battlefield in constant flux. Creativity is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth Splitter</strong> \u2013 Deal damage in a line and push adjacent units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_earth_splitter_2.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast Off</strong> \u2013 Launch the target and push back the caster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_Blast_off.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boomerang</strong> \u2013 Strike multiple targets in a single throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_Boomerang.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Two Enemies Are Alike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face an ever-changing roster of foes, each requiring a unique approach. Battle <strong>cowardly goblins</strong> that scatter under pressure, <strong>raging minotaurs</strong> that charge headfirst into danger, and <strong>flaming skeletons</strong> that explode on impact. Every encounter is a fresh tactical puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every chapter ends with a <strong>high-stakes boss fight</strong>, testing everything you\u2019ve learned. Precision, strategy, and mastery of the battlefield are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_boss.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple to Learn, Deep in Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat in <strong>Dark Pact</strong> revolves around <strong>displacement and enemy manipulation</strong>. Every attack is telegraphed, giving you the chance to <strong>intervene at the perfect moment</strong>\u2014redirecting enemies into each other\u2019s attacks, baiting them into deadly hazards, or launching an ogre straight into a pit of lava. The most effective strategies aren\u2019t always obvious, but they\u2019re always satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to test your tactics? Try the demo and see if you can master <strong>Dark Pact</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2498740?t=1744503651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2498740?t=1744503651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/1141b8b74ad8e9c808ed7a0be15d613fc54916ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744503651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/1141b8b74ad8e9c808ed7a0be15d613fc54916ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744503651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2818400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manipulate enemy positions and make use of clever combos in this tactical turn-based strategy game with a focus on creativity rather than number crunching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Carnage Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What if Into the Breach had a full campaign?</i> That question sparked the creation of <strong>Dark Pact</strong>, a game designed to push your tactical skills to the limit while delivering an emotional, gripping story. Inspired by <strong>Fire Emblem, Advance Wars, and Into the Breach</strong>, Dark Pact aims to stand alongside these legendary titles. Does it succeed? Play the demo and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_1.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master Devastating Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory isn\u2019t just about dealing damage\u2014it\u2019s about control. Abilities in Dark Pact don\u2019t just hit hard; they <strong>push, pull, taunt, and disrupt</strong>, keeping the battlefield in constant flux. Creativity is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth Splitter</strong> \u2013 Deal damage in a line and push adjacent units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_earth_splitter_2.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast Off</strong> \u2013 Launch the target and push back the caster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_Blast_off.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boomerang</strong> \u2013 Strike multiple targets in a single throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_Boomerang.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Two Enemies Are Alike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face an ever-changing roster of foes, each requiring a unique approach. Battle <strong>cowardly goblins</strong> that scatter under pressure, <strong>raging minotaurs</strong> that charge headfirst into danger, and <strong>flaming skeletons</strong> that explode on impact. Every encounter is a fresh tactical puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every chapter ends with a <strong>high-stakes boss fight</strong>, testing everything you\u2019ve learned. Precision, strategy, and mastery of the battlefield are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/Steam_page_-_boss.gif?t=1744503651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple to Learn, Deep in Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat in <strong>Dark Pact</strong> revolves around <strong>displacement and enemy manipulation</strong>. Every attack is telegraphed, giving you the chance to <strong>intervene at the perfect moment</strong>\u2014redirecting enemies into each other\u2019s attacks, baiting them into deadly hazards, or launching an ogre straight into a pit of lava. The most effective strategies aren\u2019t always obvious, but they\u2019re always satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to test your tactics? Try the demo and see if you can master <strong>Dark Pact</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Crimson Gaze"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/ed8688b403f69537f3c03a6b1fd0af7da5d56ba0/header.jpg?t=1744503651","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257050325,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050325/movie480.mp4?t=1741886572","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050325/movie_max.mp4?t=1741886572"},"name":"Dark Pact trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050325/c0af4668fe55cb310675e29653d69aeace7c61a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741886572","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050325/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741886572","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050325/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741886572"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257020196,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257020196/movie480.mp4?t=1741886577","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257020196/movie_max.mp4?t=1741886577"},"name":"Dark Pact old Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257020196/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1741886577","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamst